		!Arena championships and skilled in multiple areas show an exceptional, above-and-beyond trophy-slave.
		!There is already fame, but it does a poor job of tracking accomplishments, just public opinion of the slave.
		!Prestige bonus is more designed for singular trophies - Frobozz

